contract=a.add('sections',2,'Use two fictional books A and B. Start with zero displays and zero clicks for each. One displayed slot counts as one exposure; a click is a separate event. In this explicitly invented simulation, an A display receives a click and a B display does not. These scripted events are teaching assumptions, not observations of real readers. Compare a click-count selection policy with a predeclared A,B,A exposure plan; keep the event assumption fixed.')
